Minimal fail-to-pass extraction for openhwgroup/core-v-verif PR 2585, "Restore
Verilator compile/simulation".

The reduced testbench wrapper models the real Verilator compile fix where the
CV32E40P wrapper module was renamed to `cv32e40p_core_tb_wrapper` and the
Verilator top instantiates the renamed wrapper.  The buggy snapshot has the
renamed file/top reference but the old module declaration, reproducing the
missing-module compile failure.  The patch renames the module so the Verilator
testbench can build and drive `fetch_enable_i`.

